zyvor-fabricd (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Docker/Podman deployment support, wired up against FluxVM.
  * Hybrid Apple-style web UX; terminal UI (zyvorctl-tui) removed.
  * Fix memory limit/usage endpoints 404ing on every real VM (cgroup
    path resolved via the driver instead of a name-based lookup that
    never matched FluxVM's UUID-keyed cgroups).
  * Fix memory/disk/NIC hotplug and snapshot creation failing under a
    fresh QMP reconnect between related monitor commands.
  * Raise QMP read timeout from 10s to 300s: snapshot-save's vmstate
    dump can legitimately run past 10s under disk contention.
  * Fix VNC canvas rendering at 0x0 and swallowed console-open errors.
  * Rename Ephemera VM driver integration to FluxVM.
  * Relicense to Apache License 2.0.
  * Numerous documentation accuracy fixes (CLI examples, GPU
    passthrough capabilities, stale rebrand references).

 -- zyvor-fabricd contributors <zyvor-fabricd@example.com>  Thu, 03 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

zyvor-fabricd (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.

